# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# PRDKit Environment Configuration Template
# Copy file ini ke .env dan isi nilai yang sesuai
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# Database (PostgreSQL — pakai Neon/Supabase untuk Vercel)
# Buat akun di https://neon.tech → copy connection string → set di Vercel env vars
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@ep-xyz.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/dbname?sslmode=require

# NextAuth (PRODUCTION: ganti dengan `openssl rand -base64 32`)
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=generate-your-secret-here-with-openssl-rand-base64-32
NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000
# Di Vercel, set NEXTAUTH_URL ke https://namaproject.vercel.app (atau domain custom)

# ─── LLM Provider ───────────────────────────────────
# Opsi 1: Anthropic Claude (RECOMMENDED untuk production)
# Daftar di https://console.anthropic.com, dapatkan $5 credit gratis
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxx

# Opsi 2: AgentRouter GLM 5.2 (OpenAI-compatible, $200 free credits)
# Daftar di https://agentrouter.org/register
# Dapat $200 free credits (no credit card required)
# Provider priority: Anthropic > AgentRouter > Z.AI fallback
# AGENTROUTER_API_KEY=sk-your-agentrouter-key-here
# AGENTROUTER_MODEL=glm-5.2

# Opsi 3: Z.AI (alternatif, daftar di https://chat.z.ai)
# ZAI_API_KEY=xxxxxxxxx

# ─── Context7 (opsional, untuk fetch dokumentasi terkini) ───
# Daftar di https://context7.com
# CONTEXT7_API_KEY=xxxxxxxxx

# ─── Google OAuth (opsional, untuk login Google 1-klik) ───
# Setup lengkap: lihat GOOGLE_OAUTH_SETUP.md
# Quick start:
# 1. Buka https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Create OAuth client ID (Web application)
# 3. Authorized redirect URI: http://localhost:3000/api/auth/callback/google
#    (production: https://yourdomain.com/api/auth/callback/google)
# 4. Copy Client ID + Secret ke sini
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=xxxxxxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=GOCSPX-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ─── Email Verification (Resend, opsional) ───
# Daftar di https://resend.com, free 100 emails/day
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxx
# Email pengirim (harus domain yang sudah diverifikasi di Resend)
# EMAIL_FROM=PRDKit <noreply@prdkit.app>

# ─── Donation Link (untuk branding & monetisasi) ───
# Saweria (Indonesia, https://saweria.co), Trakteer (https://trakteer.id), atau Buy Me a Coffee
NEXT_PUBLIC_DONATION_URL=https://saweria.co/your-username
NEXT_PUBLIC_DONATION_LABEL=Traktir kopi

# ─── Upstash Redis (opsional, untuk rate limiting production) ───
# Daftar di https://upstash.com, free 10K commands/day
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://xxx.upstash.io
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=xxxxxxxxx

# ─── Sentry (error tracking, opsional tapi recommended) ───
# Daftar di https://sentry.io, free 5K errors/bulan
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=https://xxx@sentry.io/xxx
# SENTRY_ORG=your-org
# SENTRY_PROJECT=prdkit
# SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN=sntryu_xxx (untuk upload source maps saat build)

# ─── Admin Access ───
# Email yang langsung di-grant role admin (comma-separated)
# User dengan email ini akan otomatis jadi admin saat sign up / sign in
ADMIN_EMAILS=your-email@example.com

# ─── Cost Estimation (untuk admin dashboard) ───
# Estimasi biaya per PRD generate dalam USD (Claude Sonnet 4.5 ~$0.015 per PRD)
COST_PER_PRD=0.015
# Estimasi biaya per chat revision dalam USD
COST_PER_REVISION=0.005

# ─── Cron Job (untuk cost alerting harian) ───
# Generate random 32-byte: openssl rand -base64 32
# CRON_SECRET=your-cron-secret-here
# Email admin untuk menerima alert biaya
# ADMIN_ALERT_EMAIL=admin@yourdomain.com
# Threshold warning (kirim email alert)
# DAILY_COST_ALERT_THRESHOLD=5
# Threshold critical (kirim email urgent + audit log suspicious)
# DAILY_COST_CRITICAL_THRESHOLD=20

# ─── App Config ───
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=PRDKit
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
